WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
Extreme heat is never one problem.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:09.180
It sets off eighty-seven consequences, across ten systems.

3
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:13.550
Each one leads to the next, and every link has its evidence.

4
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.050
See the whole web, system by system.
